    ["Don't stand in W stun zone — walk out before the gate forms.", "Trade after he uses E — without dash his passive proc is harder.", "His R heals to previous HP — commit damage after rewind, not before.", "Push him in lane pre-6 — weak before ult.", "Buy early MR — his burst is AP-heavy."],
    ["Level 3: E + passive proc trades", "Level 6: R escape and outplay potential", "Protobelt + Lich Bane: One-shot combo"],
    ["Mercury's Treads", "Maw of Malmortius", "Hexdrinker"]
