    ["Survive levels 1-3 — her early gank is among the strongest.", "Track form — human for poke/CC, spider for all-in.", "Ward her rappel angles to predict dive paths.", "Group early — she falls off in 5v5 teamfights.", "Buy early HP — her Q is % current health."],
